Encoding: UTF-8
Type: Package
Package: susieSlide
Title: Sum of Single Effects with Genotype Sliders
Description: Fits genetic effects using the Sum of Single Effects (SuSiE)
    model with a bounded heterozygote slider for each candidate SNP and
    component. Gaussian effect coefficients are integrated analytically;
    sliders are estimated by empirical Bayes with a rare-genotype additive
    fallback. Includes the IBSS engine, compiled slider inference,
    slider-aware predictions and credible sets, and an explicitly named
    additive fitting entry point. Derived from susieR and Wang et al (2020)
    <DOI:10.1101/501114> and Zou et al (2021) <DOI:10.1101/2021.11.03.467167>.
